/dc/terms/abstract)","provider":"Open Targets Platform"},{"exact":"Although other vasculitides, such as giant cell arteritis (GCA) or immunoglobulin A vasculitis, have not benefitted by the great advantage of the large-scale genetic analyses yet, some interesting associations have been recently suggested, such as the classical functional PTPN22 allele rs2476601 (R620W) with GCA.<h4>Summary</h4>The analysis of high-throughput genotyping and exome-sequencing data has produced a considerable advance in the identification of consistent genetic risk factors in vasculitides during the last 3 years.","tags":[{"name":"PTPN22","uri":"https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Gene/Summary?db=core;g=ENSG00000134242"},{"name":"GCA","uri":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/efo/terms?short_form=EFO_1001209"}],"id":"http://europepmc.org/article/MED/25405820#opentargets-724f99160c0c389f38609004b5a1c0c2","type":"Gene Disease Relationship","section":"Abstract (http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract)","provider":"Open Targets Platform"},{"exact":"These associations include ERAP1, CCR1-CCR3, STAT4, KLRC4, GIMAP4, and TNFAIP3 in Behçet's disease; BLK and CD40 in Kawasaki disease; SERPINA1 and SEMA6A in antineutrophil cytoplasmic antibody associated vasculitides; IL12B and FCGR2A/ FCGR2A in Takayasu arteritis; and CECR1 in a newly defined vascular inflammatory syndrome associated with adenosine deaminase (ADA2) deficiency.","tags":[{"name":"STAT4","uri":"https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Gene/Summary?db=core;g=ENSG00000138378"},{"name":"Kawasaki disease","uri":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/efo/terms?short_form=EFO_0004246"}],"id":"http://europepmc.org/article/MED/25405820#opentargets-dee06cd973e72193889eb9b4fbf4ba06","type":"Gene Disease Relationship","section":"Abstract (http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract)","provider":"Open Targets Platform"},{"exact":"These associations include ERAP1, CCR1-CCR3, STAT4, KLRC4, GIMAP4, and TNFAIP3 in Behçet's disease; BLK and CD40 in Kawasaki disease; SERPINA1 and SEMA6A in antineutrophil cytoplasmic antibody associated vasculitides; IL12B and FCGR2A/ FCGR2A in Takayasu arteritis; and CECR1 in a newly defined vascular inflammatory syndrome associated with adenosine deaminase (ADA2) deficiency.","tags":[{"name":"CCR1","uri":"https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Gene/Summary?db=core;g=ENSG00000163823"},{"name":"Behçet's disease","uri":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/efo/terms?short_form=EFO_0003780"}],"id":"http://europepmc.org/article/MED/25405820#opentargets-8d615580f0f0365778c899ed915c4c9d","type":"Gene Disease Relationship","section":"Abstract (http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract)","provider":"Open Targets Platform"},{"exact":"These associations include ERAP1, CCR1-CCR3, STAT4, KLRC4, GIMAP4, and TNFAIP3 in Behçet's disease; BLK and CD40 in Kawasaki disease; SERPINA1 and SEMA6A in antineutrophil cytoplasmic antibody associated vasculitides; IL12B and FCGR2A/ FCGR2A in Takayasu arteritis; and CECR1 in a newly defined vascular inflammatory syndrome associated with adenosine deaminase (ADA2) deficiency.","tags":[{"name":"BLK","uri":"https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Gene/Summary?db=core;g=ENSG00000136573"},{"name":"Kawasaki disease","uri":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/efo/terms?short_form=EFO_0004246"}],"id":"http://europepmc.org/article/MED/25405820#opentargets-757197e6f439d94610865b80f0654a37","type":"Gene Disease Relationship","section":"Abstract (http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract)","provider":"Open Targets Platform"},{"exact":"These associations include ERAP1, CCR1-CCR3, STAT4, KLRC4, GIMAP4, and TNFAIP3 in Behçet's disease; BLK and CD40 in Kawasaki disease; SERPINA1 and SEMA6A in antineutrophil cytoplasmic antibody associated vasculitides; IL12B and FCGR2A/ FCGR2A in Takayasu arteritis; and CECR1 in a newly defined vascular inflammatory syndrome associated with adenosine deaminase (ADA2) deficiency.","tags":[{"name":"CCR3","uri":"https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Gene/Summary?db=core;g